OL,3,AEuropean diplomats attacked by Israeli
OL,4,Asettlers in West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the office of the Prime Minister
OL,7,FBenjamin Netanyahu cast doubt on what
OL,8,Fhappened and suggested it was part of a
OL,9,F"coordinated campaign to smear Israel".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
