OL,3,AAnti-government protesters battle with
OL,4,Apolice in Albania
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemonstrators and riot police fought
OL,7,Fpitched battles in the centre of Tirana
OL,8,Fon Saturday for the fifth day in a row.
OL,10,FMasked protesters, many of them high
OL,11,Fschool and university students, hurled
OL,12,Frocks and petrol bombs at riot police
OL,13,Ftrying to defend the education
OL,14,Fministry, one of the focal points of
OL,15,Fthe protests.
OL,17,FThe police responded with water cannon
OL,18,Fand volleys of tear gas, sending the
OL,19,Fcrowds scattering. There are also
OL,20,Freports that rubber bullets were used
OL,21,Ffor the first time.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
